    "hypothesis": "H_CAPACITY",
    "cf": 0.3
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "Weekend customers are {weekend_weekday_ratio:.1f}x weekday customers, so a flat staffing pattern wastes weekday labour or overloads weekends.",
